{"overview":"The summer of his high school freshman year, Hodaka runs away from his remote island home to Tokyo, and quickly finds himself pushed to his financial and personal limits. The weather is unusually gloomy and rainy every day, as if taking its cue from his life. After many days of solitude, he finally finds work as a freelance writer for a mysterious occult magazine. Then, one day, Hodaka meets Hina on a busy street corner. This bright and strong-willed girl possesses a strange and wonderful ability: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"A story about the secret of this world that only I and she know.","runtime":112,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ماکوتو شینکای"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"醍醐虎汰朗","role":"Hodaka Morishima (voice)","photo":"/i2pNaX2x4naW6Eyf4SGPypqh7To.jpg"},{"name":"森七菜","role":"Hina Amano (voice)","photo":"/92cSvqzUVbancmqFmtfgdIVBh6s.jpg"},{"name":"本田翼","role":"Natsumi Suga (voice)","photo":"/1xdR7FXHc3zeRrMyy5qHlDQr9Ou.jpg"},{"name":"吉柳咲良","role":"Nagisa Amano (voice)","photo":"/jS96RwYZLaPPhlvxKzJmb8ItURN.jpg"},{"name":"平泉成","role":"Yasui (voice)","photo":"/4zrn7ltgOCvjyk9CWrhmsS7yrlc.jpg"},{"name":"倍賞千恵子","role":"Fumi Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/u4mVoOgrqGutrPGi7ZHV1zRAtLK.jpg"},{"name":"小栗旬","role":"Keisuke Suga (voice)","photo":"/4tfrhvqp3IGHPATor0lYE9X9UD3.jpg"},{"name":"یوکی کاجی","role":"Takai (voice)","photo":"/8wKdPV11IwowfwoqGqMMNt9hmp6.jpg"},{"name":"島本須美","role":"Mamiya (voice)","photo":"/iKIDv2VFpAgzJ0uMQi7pzcMHB9i.jpg"},{"name":"香月萌衣","role":"Moka Suga (voice)","photo":"/sKuckeQVhy3xYVnhlm3EwiVwEj6.jpg"},{"name":"木村良平","role":"Kimura (voice)","photo":"/m4GktFKhjrVTewsZtqTusInHZqT.jpg"},{"name":"花澤香菜","role":"Kana (voice)","photo":"/9UTBlNRopSOKyoWnCm74tyHOfR1.jpg"}],"trailer":"gVFDCLSSQVM","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/568160/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeS